  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1804.02 Quarterly Reports. The CCC shall submit quarterly reports as provided in RSA 420-D:7-a within 45 days of the close of each quarter containing the information required by RSA 420-D:7-a.\n\nSource. #14640, eff 6-27-26, EXPIRES: 6-27-36",
